{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomberball is a sci-fi multiplayer sports game with class-based loadouts. Run, pass, and throw a planet-killer bomb into the opposing team\u2019s rift. Coordinate formations in tightly-crafted arenas. Experience the fast-paced, strategic combat of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/extras/80ef8cac4f566d8e900949392b9a53ca.poster.avif?t=1755901718\" aria-label=\"Player shoots and scores goal.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/extras/80ef8cac4f566d8e900949392b9a53ca.webm?t=1755901718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/extras/80ef8cac4f566d8e900949392b9a53ca.mp4?t=1755901718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your team to get the bomb into the enemy team's rift, by any means necessary. Fight for every inch in unforgiving stadiums, coordinate a playbook with your teammates, and position yourself for the perfect score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and perfect the art of controlling a physics-based ball objective with precision. Utilize fast reflexes and quick thinking in a variety of playstyles to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate the first person athlete experience with superhuman abilities - shield, grapple, or launch your hero into action - avoid imminent danger in intense situations or assist your team!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes casual matchmaking on a limited set of arenas and game modes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938520?t=1755901718","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938520?t=1755901718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/fce4e715c59057e0977a17ef7a27616ef560fb7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755901718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/fce4e715c59057e0977a17ef7a27616ef560fb7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755901718","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, violence, online interactions."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomberball is a sci-fi multiplayer sports game with class-based loadouts. Run, pass, and throw a planet-killer bomb into the opposing team\u2019s rift. Coordinate formations in tightly-crafted arenas. Experience the fast-paced, strategic combat of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/extras/80ef8cac4f566d8e900949392b9a53ca.poster.avif?t=1755901718\" aria-label=\"Player shoots and scores goal.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/extras/80ef8cac4f566d8e900949392b9a53ca.webm?t=1755901718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938520/extras/80ef8cac4f566d8e900949392b9a53ca.mp4?t=1755901718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your team to get the bomb into the enemy team's rift, by any means necessary. Fight for every inch in unforgiving stadiums, coordinate a playbook with your teammates, and position yourself for the perfect score!</p><p class=\"bb_parag